# SABOTAGE: E8 (ADR-046 §7 #5) — the file-blob erasure arm no longer reaches an ABOUT-a-subject
# blob: `find_subject_files/3` returns `[]` whenever the spec keys on the domain subject-FK
# `:person_id` (`if subject_field == :person_id, do: []`), so a CRM Person's `person_id`-linked
# Attachment blob (their scanned ID / signed contract) SURVIVES that person's crypto-shred — the
# exact right-to-be-forgotten gap ADR-046 §7 #5 closes. An `:uploaded_by_id` / `:id`-keyed spec is
# untouched, so this targets ONLY the about-a-subject reach (the domain subject-FK extension), not
# the D4 upload-BY arm. Flips the reach proof (the person's about-them blob must be GONE after shred).
# APP: samen_core
# TEST_FILES: test/files_delete_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: shredding a Person deletes their person_id-linked Attachment blob
diff --git a/samen_core/lib/samen/files/erasure.ex b/samen_core/lib/samen/files/erasure.ex
